@startuml
title Enterprise Knowledge Graph (EKG) - Node/Edge Schema (Causal + Confidence)

left to right direction
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 55

skinparam DefaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #2C3E50

skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #F7F9FC
  BorderColor #2C3E50
  FontColor #2C3E50
}

legend left
  == Evidence Class ==
  confirmed_causal | probable_causal | correlated_only |
  expert_defined_rule | statistically_supported_link | inferred_dependency
endlegend

class Node {
  +node_id
  +node_type
  tenant_id
  domain
  geo_id
  valid_from_ts
  valid_to_ts
  source_refs[]
  last_updated_ts
}

class Edge {
  +edge_id
  +from_node_id
  +to_node_id
  relationship_type
  direction
  evidence_class
  confidence_0_1
  basis_ref
  valid_from_ts
  valid_to_ts
  source_refs[]
}

class CausalHypothesis {
  +hypothesis_id
  statement
  status
  primary_edge_id
  supporting_evidence_ids[]
  confidence_0_1
  last_reviewed_ts
  owner_group
}

class EvidenceItem {
  +evidence_id
  source_system
  source_type
  observed_ts
  freshness_minutes
  classification
  confidence_0_1
  uri
}

Node "1" <-- "0..*" Edge : from
Node "1" <-- "0..*" Edge : to

Edge "1" <-- "0..*" CausalHypothesis : primary
EvidenceItem "0..*" --> "0..*" CausalHypothesis : supports

note right of Edge
Must satisfy decision standards:
- evidence_class is explicit
- confidence drives graph_confidence
- temporal validity supported
end note

note right of CausalHypothesis
Governance lifecycle:
proposed -> validated -> deprecated
Owner and review cadence required
end note

@enduml

